---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BookIntro from '../components/BookIntro.astro';
import FocusArea from '../components/FocusArea.astro';
import ResourceCard from '../components/ResourceCard.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Directed Edges / Systems design and architecture"
  description="Get help with challenges like token taxonomy, composition, and library ecosystems to propel your design system forward by consulting with Nathan Curtis and the Directed Edges team."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-16">
    <SectionLabel label="Services" />
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight mb-6">System design and architecture</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-8">
      Need help with design tokens, component design, or managing your library ecosystem? We've got the expertise to guide you through these challenges. Whether you need us to dive in and solve problems or help you learn as you go, we're here to keep your design system on track.
    </p>
    <BookIntro />

    <FocusArea title="Design tokens">
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Using tokens for the first time? Supporting dark mode too? Theming for 50+ brands? Mystified by semantic and component tokens? We'll help you craft effective tokens to unlock myriad opportunities.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 mt-6">
        <ResourceCard
          title="Naming Tokens in Design Systems"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/naming-tokens-in-design-systems-9e86c7444676"
          description="Nathan's writing on effective token naming for a team's shared understanding across design, code, and handoffs."
          source="Medium.com, 230,000+ views"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          title="Verizon's Figma Color Variables"
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LjFIUk1MNp8"
          description="We led the Verizon Design System team to deliver design tokens as Figma variables, which the team presented to Figma's Framework."
          source="Youtube.com"
        />
      </ul>
    </FocusArea>

    <FocusArea title="Component design and production">
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">In order to scale, design systems UI components must be high-quality and robust to serve widely shared needs. We'll help you architect API, design solutions, and handoff cleanly.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 mt-6">
        <ResourceCard
          title="Crafting Component API, Together"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/crafting-ui-component-api-together-81946d140371"
          description="Cross-disciplinary teams identify what to include, when to fit API into a workflow, where to author together, and how behaviors change."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          title="Component specifications"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/component-specifications-1492ca4c94c"
          description="Dig into the details of how to specify a component's anatomy, property configurations, layout and more."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
      </ul>
    </FocusArea>

    <FocusArea title="Component composition">
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">To scale, design systems must be flexible. Yet catalogs and features are opinionated and rigid. Changes take too long. Adopters wanting a remix end up frustrated and fork design and code. Is that the future you seek? We can help you do much better with the components and patterns that matter most.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 mt-6">
        <ResourceCard
          title="Make and share more flexible UI components"
          href="https://webexpo.net/blog/make-designers-fall-in-love-with-your-design-system/"
          description="Nathan presents at WebExpo on findings on UI component composition sourced from many client projects."
          source="Video of WebExpo Prague Talk, April 2023"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          title="Subcomponents"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/subcomponents-753ce9f6600a"
          description="How to divide components into reusable chunks and flexible containers, dispersing an API across parts as you go."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
      </ul>
    </FocusArea>

    <FocusArea title="Library ecosystems &amp; tiers">
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Groups want to make and share components too. However, a federated approach is difficult. Quality stinks. Process hinders. It's just all chaotically organized. We can help you create a platform, curate contributions, and enable sharing across teams.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 mt-6">
        <ResourceCard
          title="Design System Tiers"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/design-system-tiers-2c827b67eae1"
          description="Improve capabilities and quality to promote ideas from a team or group upward through an architecture everyone shares."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          title="Figma Shared Libraries"
          href="https://medium.com/eightshapes-llc/figma-shared-libraries-d2dfbf9d1b8d"
          description="Inspiring thoughts of roles, tasks, and the library life cycle to get your team started."
          source="Medium.com"
        />
      </ul>
    </FocusArea>

    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <section class="my-16 py-12 border-t border-border">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-4">Ready to get started?</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-6">Let's connect to discuss your project's goals, scope and approach.</p>
      <BookIntro />
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
